  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A wounded demonic Gu Master tells the river girl who saved him that if she has difficulties she can go to Dan Huo Mountain’s Gui Ku cave and find him for help, and that even after she dies the promise stays effective for a future owner of the half-token. Less than fifty years later, a huge battle on Dan Huo mountain and a volcano eruption destroy Gui Ku cave, and Tie clan captures that demonic Gu Master and throws him into the demon suppression tower. After that destruction the half-token loses its use and is passed around by the young girl’s descendants.",
